step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Launa</col> told me that her son <col=800000>Tolna</col> went down into the rift east of <col=800000>Varrock</col> and never came back. I should find a way down into the rift.</col>
step	2	2	After tying the rope
line	<str>Launa told me that her son Tolna went down into the rift east of Varrock and never came back.</str>
line	<col=000080>I tied a rope to the edge of the rift. I should climb down and look for <col=800000>Tolna</col>.</col>
step	3	3	In the room of rage
line	<str>Launa told me that her son Tolna went down into the rift east of Varrock and never came back.</str>
line	<str>I tied a rope to the edge of the rift.</str>
line	<col=000080>Below the rift I found a room full of angry creatures. The rack holds weapons that each hurt only one kind of them. I need to kill enough of them to fill the rage.</col>
step	4	4	After the room of rage
line	<str>Launa told me that her son Tolna went down into the rift east of Varrock and never came back.</str>
line	<str>I tied a rope to the edge of the rift.</str>
line	<str>Below the rift I found a room full of angry creatures. The rack holds weapons that each hurt only one kind of them.</str>
line	<col=000080>I filled the rage and moved on. The next room is full of dark holes, and something is hiding in them.</col>
step	5	6	After the room of fear
line	<str>Launa told me that her son Tolna went down into the rift east of Varrock and never came back.</str>
line	<str>I tied a rope to the edge of the rift.</str>
line	<str>Below the rift I found a room full of angry creatures. The rack holds weapons that each hurt only one kind of them.</str>
line	<str>I filled the rage and moved on.</str>
line	<col=000080>I killed the fear reapers hiding in the dark. The next room is full of confusing beasts; only one of them is real.</col>
step	6	8	After the room of confusion
line	<str>Launa told me that her son Tolna went down into the rift east of Varrock and never came back.</str>
line	<str>I tied a rope to the edge of the rift.</str>
line	<str>Below the rift I found a room full of angry creatures. The rack holds weapons that each hurt only one kind of them.</str>
line	<str>I filled the rage and moved on.</str>
line	<str>I killed the fear reapers hiding in the dark.</str>
line	<col=000080>I found the real beasts and the last door opened. The final room is full of hopeless creatures.</col>
